{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01792","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 一 · 柳宗元","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见夸父逐日窥虞渊，跳踉北海超崑仑。\n披霄决汉出沆漭，瞥裂左右遗星辰。\n须臾力尽道渴死，狐鼠蜂蚁争噬吞。\n北方竫人长九寸，开口抵掌更笑喧。\n啾啾饮食滴与粒，生死亦足终天年。\n睢盱大志少成遂，坐使儿女相悲怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}